seg-61d8ec169a17 = The CRC routine was checked against the CRC the documentation states for its own <c1/> example (cited, not quoted); the tests use self-written lines. Not read: abbreviated ASCII, other logs. The jammer flag is the receiver's own report, not Kshana's finding; agreement with Kshana's monitors is not validation.

